# Unblessed: Session Store Grant bindings and replay (#538); first blessing awaits human review.
# Two aliases share games; the unbound Store uses default. Stores outlive :restore.
> :grant scores store games
> :grant same store games
> :grant other store
> on score
|   ask scores to increment "plays", 3
|   say it
| end score
> on peek
|   ask same to get "plays"
|   say it
|   ask other to get "plays"
|   say it
| end peek
> score
